# Benefits of AI for Students

AI tools offer many advantages:

- Save time
- Improve productivity
- Enhance writing
- Simplify research
- Support learning
- Help with coding
- Organize information
- Prepare for exams

Used wisely, AI can become a valuable study companion.

---

# Limitations of AI

Students should also understand AI's limitations.

AI may:

- Produce incorrect information
- Misunderstand questions
- Generate outdated content
- Miss important context
- Require fact checking

Always verify important academic information using reliable sources.

