# Frequently Asked Questions

## Are AI tools free for students?

Many AI tools offer generous free plans, although premium features often require a subscription.

## Which AI tool is best for homework?

ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and Perplexity AI are excellent choices for understanding concepts and solving academic problems.

## Can AI help with programming?

Yes. GitHub Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini can explain code, fix bugs, and teach programming concepts.

## Should students rely completely on AI?

No. AI should support learning, not replace critical thinking or independent study.

## Are AI tools worth using in 2026?

Absolutely. AI tools can improve productivity, simplify studying, and help students learn more efficiently when used responsibly.

